N":"INICIAR SESI\xd3N","You must be at least 18 years old to continue.":"Debes tener 18 a\xf1os como m\xednimo para continuar.","{0} Chat - Beta":"{0} Chat - Beta","Tap for Details":"Pulse para obtener detalles","Add your mobile phone number to secure your account and help your friends find you":"Agregar su n\xfamero de tel\xe9fono m\xf3vil para asegurar su cuenta y ayudar a sus amigos a encontrarle","Mobile Number":"N\xfamero de tel\xe9fono m\xf3vil","Network failure":"Falla de la red","Secure Your Account":"Asegurar su cuenta","Success! Your have accepted {0}'s friend request.":"\xa1\xc9xito! Usted acept\xf3 la solicitud de amistad de {0}.","This message was not delivered":"Este mensaje no se ha entregado","To help keep our games fair, please enable replay recording.":"Para ayudar a que nuestros juegos sean justos, habilita la grabaci\xf3n de repetici\xf3n.","Tournament is about to end!":"El torneo est\xe1 a punto de finalizar!","Unable to get connected users. Please try again later.":"No se pudieron obtener usuarios conectados. Int\xe9ntalo de nuevo m\xe1s tarde.","Waiting for Next Round":"Esperando la pr\xf3xima ronda","Your score may not be submitted if you do not complete this next game before the timer runs out!":"Su puntaje no puede enviarse si no completa el siguiente juego antes de que se detenga el temporizador.",Connecting:"Conectando","Exciting tournaments and live events await!":"\xa1Te esperan emocionantes torneos y eventos en vivo!","League Results":"Resultados de la liga","Player Details":"Detalles del jugador","<p>By tapping 'Submit', I agree to the <u>Terms of Service and the Privacy Policy.</u></p>":"<p>Al seleccionar \"Enviar\", acepto los <u>T\xe9rminos de Servicio y la Pol\xedtica de Privacidad.</u></p>","A BRAND NEW WAY TO PLAY":"UNA NUEVA MANERA DE JUGAR","ARE YOU READY TO WIN?":"\xbfEST\xc1 LISTO PARA GANAR?","Add Funds":"Agregar Fondos","Add cash to play for real money":"Agregar efectivo para jugar por dinero real.","Age Verification":"Verificaci\xf3n de edad","BONUS AMOUNT":"SUMA DE LA BONIFICACI\xd3N","CONFIRM DEPOSIT":"CONFIRMAR DEP\xd3SITO","CONFIRM PURCHASE":"CONFIRMAR COMPRA","DEPOSIT NOW":"DEPOSITAR AHORA","Delete Credit Card":"Eliminar Tarjeta de Cr\xe9dito","Description:":"Descripci\xf3n:",EDIT:"EDITAR","ENTER PROMO CODE:":"INTRODUCIR C\xd3DIGO PROMOCIONAL:","Enjoying the competition?":"\xbfEst\xe1 disfrutando la competencia?","Enter your date of birth to continue":"Introduzca su fecha de nacimiento para continuar","Even More Rewards!":"\xa1Incluso m\xe1s recompensas!","Exciting tournaments, live events, and amazing prizes await!":"\xa1Le esperan emocionantes torneos, eventos en vivo y precios incre\xedbles!","Exp Date":"Fecha de Vencimiento","HOW DOES IT WORK?":"\xbfC\xd3MO FUNCIONA?","I agree to the Terms of Service and Privacy Policy":"Acepto los T\xe9rminos de Servicio y la Pol\xedtica de privacidad","MAYBE LATER":"QUIZ\xc1S M\xc1S TARDE","Out of Funds":"Ya no tiene fondos","PROMO CODE IS INVALID OR HAS EXPIRED":"EL C\xd3DIGO PROMOCIONAL NO ES V\xc1LIDO O HA VENCIDO","Placed: {0}":"Ubicaci\xf3n: {0}","Prize Details":"Detalles del premio",SVC:"CVV","Select Payment Method":"Seleccionar M\xe9todo de Pago","Skillz matches you with players of similar ability, so the competitions are always fun and fair.":"Skillz lo conecta con jugadores con capacidades similares para que las competencias sean siempre divertidas y justas.","Sorry to hear that. How can we improve?":"Sentimos mucho escuchar eso. \xbfC\xf3mo podemos mejorar?","Submit your feedback - we're listening":"Env\xede sus comentarios, estamos escuchando",T:"T","Tap a star to rate":"Pulse una estrella para calificar","Unfortunately you cannot make a deposit at this time because you have a withdrawal pending.":"Desafortunadamente no puede hacer un dep\xf3sito en este momento porque tiene un retiro pendiente.","Users must be at least 18 years or older to continue.":"Los usuarios deben tener al menos 18 a\xf1os de edad para continuar.","VS {0} Players":"CONTRA {0} Jugadores",Versus:"Contra","Win or Lose, you'll earn Ticketz for each match you play.  Redeem them for awesome prizes in the Ticketz store!":"Ganes o pierdas, obtendr\xe1s Ticketz con cada partida que juegues.  \xa1Canj\xe9alas por incre\xedbles premios en la tienda Ticketz!","Withdrawal Pending":"Retiro pendiente","Write to Skillz support here...":"Escriba a soporte de Skillz aqu\xed...","You Won {0}{1}":"Ha ganado {0}{1}","You beat {0}! Tap Next to see what you won!":"\xa1Ha derrotado a {0}! \xa1Pulse Siguiente para ver lo que ganaste!","Your match history is summarized on the Home screen. Tap \"Games\" to find your next match!":"Su historial de partidas se resumen en la pantalla Inicio. \xa1Pulse \"Juegos\" para buscar su siguiente partida!","Zip Code":"C\xf3digo Postal","{0} is used to enter practice matches against other players.":"{0} se usa para ingresar a partidas de pr\xe1ctica contra otros jugadores.","{0} now has multiplayer competitions powered by Skillz":"{0} ahora tiene competencias con m\xfaltiples jugadores patrocinadas por Skillz","{0}{1}":"{0}{1}","Age Verify":"Verificar Edad","By tapping 'Submit' I agree to the Terms of Service and the Privacy Policy.":"Al seleccionar \"Enviar\", acepto los T\xe9rminos de Servicio y la Pol\xedtica de Privacidad.","Clicking \\'Spectate\\' will bring you to a live stream of the event in progress. You may want to open the link on another device so you can play and watch at the same time. \n \n":"Hacer clic en \\'Observar\\' te llevar\xe1 a una transmisi\xf3n en directo del evento en progreso. Es posible que desees abrir el v\xednculo en otro dispositivo para que puedas jugar y ver al mismo tiempo. \n \n","Enter your birthday to play for cash":"Ingresar su fecha de nacimiento para jugar por dinero","GO PRO":"JUGAR EN MODO PROFESIONAL","I agree to the Terms of Service":"Acepto los T\xe9rminos de Servicio","MATCH\nDETAILS":"DETALLES DE\nPARTIDA","NO BONUS":"SIN BONIFICACI\xd3N","PLAY FOR CASH":"JU